     1396   MAIN-BLOCK:
     1397   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     1398      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     1399     RUN enable_UI.
     1400     WAIT-FOR GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1401   END.
     1402   RUN disable_UI.
     1403   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     1404     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1405   END PROCEDURE.
     1406   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     1407     DISPLAY date-1 date-2 TOG-inv
     1408         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1409     ENABLE Btn-Cancel Btn_OK B-Help RECT-1 date-1 date-2 TOG-inv
     1410         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1411     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1412   END PROCEDURE.
